## New diagnostic module

```diff
warning: in the working copy of 'core/pit_diagnosis/task11_ca_provenance.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it
diff --git a/core/pit_diagnosis/task11_ca_provenance.py b/core/pit_diagnosis/task11_ca_provenance.py
